  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "C.Ebrahim Haji vs Vatakara Muncipality on 6 February, 2024 Author: P.V.Kunhikrishnan Bench: P.V.Kunhikrishnan In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.V.Kunhikrishnan Tuesday, The 6Th Day Of February 2024 / 17Th Magha, 1945 Wp(C) No. 23813 Of 2014 Petitioner: C.Ebrahim Haji Aged 59 Years S/O.Kunhi Marakkar, Safeera Manzil, Mukkolabhagam, Vatakara, Kozhikode Dist By Advs. Sri.K.P.Sudheer Sri.Arun Mathew Vadakkan Respondents: 1 Vatakara Muncipality Vatakara, Pin-673101,Rep By Its Secretary 2 Municipal Council Vatakara Municipality, Vatakara-673101, Rep By Its Chairman By Adv Sri.T.Naveen, Sc, Vatakara Municipality This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Come Up For Admission On 06.02.2024, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: W.P. No.23813 of 2014 :2 : P.V.Kunhikrishnan, J. --------------------------------------------- W.P. No.23813 of 2014 ------------------------------------------------------ Dated this the 6th day of February, 2024. Judgment",
    "facts": "2. Petitioner is a resident of 1 st respondent Municipality. It is the case of the petitioner that for the last twenty five years, he is conducting business of sale of meat in Stall No.4 of Ward No.30 of the 1 st respondent Municipality. The business is being conducted after obtaining requisite licence from the Municipality. According to the petitioner, at the instance of business rivals, proceedings were initiated against the petitioner's business in animal hide and Ext.P1 is the final order passed by the Tribunal in such proceedings. and the petitioner submitted Ext.P4 objection on 26.8.2013. 3. The petitioner filed a statutory appeal and a petition for stay of the proceedings. Since no orders are passed on the stay petition, the petitioner filed W.P. No.22908 of 2015 before this Court.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
